  output holds content boolean

```



        (C) a taxpayer shall be considered as married at the close of his taxable year if his spouse (other than a spouse described in subparagraph (B)) died during the taxable year.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0021; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(2)(C); source-lines: 51-51; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
scope SpouseDiedInYear:
  definition holds equals
    exists m among (W.marriage_event_values of world) such that
      m.agents contains taxpayer
      and (exists sp among m.agents such that
             (match spouse with pattern
              -- Absent: true
              -- Present content s: s.id = sp.id)
             and not (output of SpouseNonresidentAlien with {
                        -- world: world -- taxpayer: taxpayer
                        -- spouse: Present content sp
                        -- taxable_year: taxable_year }).holds
             and (exists dv among (W.death_event_values of world) such that
                    dv.agents contains sp
                    and (exists td among (W.date_values of dv.starts) such that
                           ((number of (W.date_values of m.ends)) = 0
                            or (exists me among (W.date_values of m.ends) such that td <= me))
                           and (W.first_day_year of taxable_year) <= td
                           and td <= (W.last_day_year of taxable_year))))
```

